_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "1", "image": "engenn6le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, enough about me. What's happening with you these days? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Actually, I have some good news at work. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? What is it? You won another million dollars? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey - enough wisecracks out of you!  Well, it kind of feels like that. I got promoted!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow! Congratulations. You are a real go-getter, Sal. I'm not surprised, really.<br>"}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn6le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks. So, I'm having a meeting with the editor in chief next week. I'm nervous about that \u2026<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You? Nervous? You're always so gregarious. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The editor is a little ruthless. I mean, she's brilliant and obviously an excellent manager, but people say she is hard to please. She always looks fierce - ready to take on anything.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Kind of like you! I'll bet the meeting is going to go just fine. Don't be such a worry-wort. <br>"}, {"time": "60000", "image": "engenn6le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right. I'll try to be more optimistic about it.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Are you going to call me next week and tell me how it went?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. I'll call you on Monday night. Wish me luck!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Fingers crossed for you, Sal. <br>"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "t